ncomplete task\"> Software save sends <code class=\"notranslate\">type: 5</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role-incompatible equipment types never submitted</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role-specific empty states</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Locale keys: Software, Level, Description, Beginner/Intermediate/Advanced/Proficient, 3D Scanner</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ref: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/prd.md</code> · <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/brief.md</code></p>",
