      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Branch:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">design/photographer-directory-role</code></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-11a9a3a8-12a2-4be6-9437-fdadf4afd3ff.png\"><img width=\"1682\" height=\"984\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-11a9a3a8-12a2-4be6-9437-fdadf4afd3ff.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 984px;; aspect-ratio: 1682 / 984; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Page:</strong> <a href=\"http://localhost:3002/support/featured-photographers\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://localhost:3002/support/featured-photographers</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">PRD 5.6 — support surfaces expose the new role fields.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Request list</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role column added, using the shared label mapping</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Existing columns unchanged (full name, subscription, user ID, request date, status, actions)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Confirm the support list endpoint returns <code class=\"notranslate\">role</code> (OQ-3) — coordinate backend if not</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Review Photographer modal</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Profile tab shows Role, Timezone, Language</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Gear tab for <code class=\"notranslate\">photographer_360</code>: Drone, 360 Camera, DSLR, 3D Scanner (Name, Brand, Key specification)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Gear tab for <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code>: Software only (Name, Level, Description)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role-specific empty states</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Approve/deny workflow unchanged</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Locale keys: support role column, Review Profile/Gear labels</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ref: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/prd.md</code> · <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/brief.md</code></p>",
