      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-gothru-dashboard-4206",
      "display_title": "Issue #4206: Photographer Directory: role selection step on the apply page",
      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Photographer Directory apply page now asks the applicant to pick a role before submitting, so services and tools can be scoped to the role from day one.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Branch:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">design/photographer-directory-role</code></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-6a7576df-fe3f-4c3b-91ec-d87774281e4b.png\"><img width=\"1679\" height=\"978\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-6a7576df-fe3f-4c3b-91ec-d87774281e4b.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 978px;; aspect-ratio: 1679 / 978; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Step 1 - Choose your role</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Radio cards above the location field: <code class=\"notranslate\">360 Photographer</code> (on-site capture: 360 photography, virtual tours, Street View publishing, video and drone shooting) and <code class=\"notranslate\">Image Processing</code> (remote production: nadir patching, stitching, HDR blending, object removal, virtual staging, floor plans).</li>\n<li>Helper copy: \"This decides the services and tools shown on your profile.\"</li>\n<li>Keyboard + ARIA handled by the NextUI <code class=\"notranslate\">RadioGroup</code> primitive.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Step 2 - Set your service location</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Existing Find Location / Lat-Long search, unchanged.</li>\n<li>Helper copy: \"Clients discover you on the map from this location.\"</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Submit</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">Apply to Get Featured</code> blocks submission when no role is selected and shows the <code class=\"notranslate\">t_role_required</code> message - no request fired.</li>\n<li>Payload sends <code class=\"notranslate\">role</code>, plus defaulted <code class=\"notranslate\">timezone</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">language</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Out of scope</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Timezone / language pickers on the apply page (defaulted here, edited in the profile flow).</li>\n<li>Changes to role values, services scoping, or the profile/tools pages.</li>\n</ul>",
      "metadata": {
